# Normalise line endings in the repository.
# `text=auto` lets git detect text files and store them with LF, whatever the
# machine they were committed from used. .editorconfig asked for this and could
# not enforce it: django-bootstrap4 still has a CRLF file in src/, and
# django-bootstrap5 had to fix the same one by hand in 26.4.
#
# Deliberately not `eol=lf`, which would also dictate line endings in the working
# tree. What matters is what the repository stores; how a checkout looks on
# someone else's machine is their business.

* text=auto
